# Copy to .env.server (server-side values) / .env.local and fill in.
# Only the analytics keys are documented here so far; see IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md for the rest.

# Hotjar Site ID, digits only (Hotjar: Settings -> Sites & Organizations).
# Blank disables Hotjar entirely -- no script requested, no session recorded.
#
# NOT a secret: it ships inside client-side JavaScript that any visitor can read. It belongs in a
# plain variable (or CI variable), not a secret store.
#
# Next freezes NEXT_PUBLIC_* into the bundle at `next build`, so this value is only the fallback:
#   - local / this repo   -> public/runtime-config.js  (takes effect on the next page load)
#   - docker image build  -> docker build --build-arg NEXT_PUBLIC_HOTJAR_SITE_ID=$HOTJAR_SITE_ID .
NEXT_PUBLIC_HOTJAR_SITE_ID=6766543
